# CCTV REVIEW SUMMARY — cam10, Pakwan/Palwan Cross Road
**Date:** 28-08-2025 | **Coverage:** 10:30–11:29 (60 minutes, reviewed as minutes 0–59)

---

## 1. SCENE
Cam10 overlooks Pakwan/Palwan Cross Road, a major multi-lane junction carrying mixed urban traffic. Footage spans 10:30 to approximately 11:29 in daylight. Road surface appeared wet with vehicle reflections at minute 46, suggesting recent rain. No lighting anomalies noted.

## 2. TRAFFIC AND PEOPLE
Continuous heavy mixed traffic for the full hour:
- **Cars:** dozens throughout, predominantly white, plus silver, grey, black, maroon/red and one recurring pink/red hatchback.
- **Two-wheelers:** large numbers of helmeted motorcyclists and scooter riders constantly filtering between lanes (notable riders in white, yellow, pink, red/maroon and teal shirts; a woman in pink on a scooter, min 30; a cyclist in yellow, min 38).
- **Auto-rickshaws:** many green-and-yellow autos, at times 8–10 simultaneously (mins 25–49).
- **Goods three-wheelers:** yellow, orange, cream with blue tarpaulin, and green "PRINCE" livery (mins 50–59); a blue three-wheeler goods carrier recurring (mins 31–33, 39, 42–44).
- **Buses:** white Tata bus (min 7); yellow Eicher "NIRMA UNIVERSITY" bus and a blue/yellow "Where Practice Meets Theory" bus (min 24); Nirma University yellow bus stationary in foreground (mins 25–27); red city buses with Gujarati LED displays (mins 26, 31, 43–45).
- **Trucks/commercial:** white Tata goods truck (min 4); white "Rudra" delivery van (min 2); white tempo with yellow tarpaulin canopy (min 14); taxi with roof sign and yellow plate (min 16); grey "LUCKY"/"AJ ABS WRAP" cargo truck (min 19); white container truck, tipper lorry and concrete mixer truck (min 21); cream "SHRIGI GOODS CANVAS" truck (min 25); yellow-cab "PREMIUM EDIBLE OILS/CABLES" canopy truck (mins 40–42); "RASHI DEWAXED PREMIUM EDIBLE OILS" truck (min 42); white "GOODS CARRIAGE" vans (mins 43–45); white Tata goods truck and dark blue container truck (min 46); white "Jamnagar Transport Co." truck (min 59).
- **Other:** white SML ambulance-type van with light bar (min 0); red tractor with tanker trailer (min 12) and tractor with tanker/bowser (mins 32, 42); red open-top Mahindra-style jeep (min 20) and red open-top off-road vehicle (mins 42–45); concrete mixer/tanker trailer (mins 43–44); white ambulance (min 58); yellow JCB-type construction vehicle briefly at top right (min 54).
- **Pedestrians:** repeatedly on or crossing the carriageway — man with backpack between lanes and a woman with two children along the lane edge (min 0); man in olive-green shirt with shopping bag crossing in front of moving vehicles (min 12); two men on foot crossing before traffic (min 16); woman in red patterned dress between queued vehicles (min 21); woman in orange/yellow sari at carriageway edge (min 22); man in blue shirt (mins 25, 41); person in white shirt (min 25); woman in green outfit appearing to interact with occupants (min 29); person in olive-green head covering (min 30); man in grey shirt among cars throughout min 47; several men with backpacks (min 49); man in light blue shirt (min 50); man in blue-and-white striped shirt and older bald man in pink shirt and jeans crossing centre (min 56); woman in red sari crossing top-right (min 58).

